<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Jefferson Cty, Ala., at 1330 EST.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Jefferson Cty, Ala., at 1330 EST.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James &amp; Associates Inc said Thursday Jefferson County, Ala.'s $259 million sewer bond issue will be free to trade at 1330 EST Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
